    description: Some("Four ways to pass the time with a deck: American Page One, where you block your opponents and try to go out alone; poker and blackjack played against a coin balance you bet from; and a fortune-telling draw. A versus mode adds a second player, and an alarm timer can be set so a long session doesn\'t carry you past your train stop."),
